# Styling Validation with CSS 🎨

CSS provides pseudo-classes to style form elements according to their validation state:

```css_not
/* Highlights fields when they are valid or invalid */
input:valid {
  border: 2px solid green;
}

input:invalid {
  border: 2px solid red;
}

/* Highlights required fields */
input:required {
  background-color: #fffbeb;
}

/* Styles button when disabled */
button:disabled {
  opacity: 0.5;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}
```
